    "low_then_rising": "91-180, 181-365 days vs 0-90 days (unadjusted): rate ratio 0.90 (95% CI 0.58-1.41), no direction can be read from it; two-sided p = 0.651. Not statistically significant at the 5% level: the data do not reject equal rates (rate ratio 1); the 95% CI runs from 0.58 to 1.41, which includes 1. Repeat events: 62 in 91-180, 181-365 days and 28 in 0-90 days.",
